,"site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T16:15:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T16:15:36Z","body":"> The SHA was required because caches are immutable. If we wanted to save with the exact same name, it'd need to be immediately preceeded by deleting the existing cache.\r\n\r\nHm, seems like I misread my results in another repo where I experimented with this. It looked to me like it was able to just replace the cache by a new entry with the same name, but now I see indeed that it's failing and still using a 2 days old cache from when I first did that change.\r\n\r\nThis isn't going to work then :(","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2721845794/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]